  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUse your calculator to reflect the image triangle from part \u003cb\u003eb\u003c/b\u003e across the \u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e–axis. Find the coordinates of the vertices of the image triangle.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eFrom where you left off in part \u003cb\u003eb\u003c/b\u003e, press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19062\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qwindow.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19062\u0026quot;,255)\"\u003e (\"TRFM\") to transform the graph.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eFrom where you left off in part \u003cb\u003eb\u003c/b\u003e, press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19063\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qwindow.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19063\u0026quot;,255)\"\u003e (\"TRFM\") to transform the graph. Select \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19064\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e for a reflection.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-1 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_7_1_geometry_3c_60/f-60-3c-1.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSelect the triangle in the first quadrant, and the line of reflection.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePosition the cursor over one of the vertices of the triangle in the first quadrant, and press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19065\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19065\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e to select the object to be reflected.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThen select 2 points to identify the line of reflection. Since we are reflecting across the \u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e–axis, choose any two points on the \u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e–axis.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-3 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_7_1_geometry_3c_60/f-60-3c-2-anim.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19066\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qwindow.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19066\u0026quot;,255)\"\u003e (\"COPY\") to show both the original and the image triangle. Find the coordinates of the vertices of the image triangle.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19067\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qwindow.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19067\u0026quot;,255)\"\u003e (\"COPY\") to show both the original and the image triangle.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe vertices of the image triangle are at (2, 1), (1, –1), and (1, –3).\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_7_1_geometry_3c_60/f-60-3c-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
